<p>Set up some cunning contingency plans in case of death.</p><p>If you die you will have the option to raise back from the dead once, by becoming a ghoul or a skeleton (you can choose which).</p><p>When rising this way you will keep access to your racial tree and gain access to the ghoul or skeleton racial tree with 2 levels of each talents already learnt.</p><p>As undead will not able to use infusions anymore.</p><p>If you choose to become a skeleton, the Re-assemble talent will consider that you already used your resurrection.</p>